data_ptte2
# Phase identity: layered 1T CdI2-type PtTe2, P-3m1, Z=1.
# Provenance: Furuseth, Selte, and Kjekshus, Acta Chem. Scand. 19,
# 257--258 (1965), doi:10.3891/acta.chem.scand.19-0257;
# COD 1537197 (CC0): https://www.crystallography.net/cod/1537197.cif
# The source 1a Pt and 2d Te sites are expanded explicitly in P1. Layers
# stack along c; primitive P-3m1 permits a finite basal (001) reflection.
# Limiting checks: V=sqrt(3)a^2c/2, 1Pt+2Te, finite (001) coupling.
# Validation: ptte2-p3m1-structure
